Z||000000||tomanyfieros||11-22-2001||06:17 PM||||well, my dad got this deal, 2 raptors, 2 helmets, 2 sets of gloves and a trailor for $150 a month for 5 yrs. (when u do the mathm $9,000 for all) well he called, and the guy said it was for what i listed above, then dad gets it aproved and then calls back and the guy said it was for 1 raptor 1 helmet, and one pair of gloves. Well dad was mad and said to take the raptor off the truck, im not doing the deal. Well the yamaha people came around to the deal and dad signed the paper. they droped one off and they were to drop off the 2nd one last night. Well u are probly thinking, whats the big deal? they droped one off and they are running behind - WRONG, dad signed the paper that says ONE raptor and not the 2, they forgot to switch it. and dad already signed it..... so they might not be droping off a 2nd raptor..... these retail at $6500 new, and they are the 2002 and they will FLY! 90mph 4 wheeler....(anyone want to post the pics for me?) what do u think dad should do? i like the raptor, but they have not droped off a trailor, 2 helmets, or 2 pairs of gloves..... what should he do if they dont drop them off? Jason <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dreamer.gif">    <BR><B>We all have dreams, but not everyone gets them...</B>||||reg||1
