Z||000006||Sage||11-22-2001||10:40 PM||||In Ohio, I believe it's 3 business days, BUT, that generally refers to a situation where the seller approached you and you bit.  When you go to the seller and ask for their product and sign their agreement, you are kinda legally, sol.  You may, however, be able to cancel the loan agreement with your lender if you act fast.  Check with a contract attorney.<P>Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
